# Docs

`docs/` is the record of decisions. Update it in the same change that makes the decision.

- `docs/product.md` — what this repo is and is not
- `docs/desktop-layout.md` — the editor stack, and the index of the topic notes
- `docs/header.md` — the project bar
- `docs/export.md` — the export dialog
- `docs/library.md` — the icon rail and the asset panel
- `docs/preview.md` — the frame and the transport
- `docs/inspector.md` — the clip and project panels
- `docs/timeline.md` — the toolbar, tracks, and edits
- `docs/ruler.md` — ruler steps and tick drawing
- `docs/playhead.md` — the playhead mark and line
- `docs/time.md` — frame rate, timecode, and drop frame
- `docs/icons.md` — Hugeicons free set and the icon map
- `docs/decisions.md` — short log of choices already made
- `docs/capcut-desktop-re.md` — CapCut desktop track kinds, from the installed app

Add a new file when a topic does not fit these. Keep each file short. Do not paste chat history into docs.
